# TDC Valheim Installer v0.4.0

This version installs the contents of the repository's `BepInExPack_Valheim`
folder directly into the Valheim root directory.

## Important

Upload/replace the root `manifest.json` in the GitHub repository with the
included manifest before testing the installer.

The installer downloads the repository ZIP for `main`, locates
`BepInExPack_Valheim`, and copies the CONTENTS of that folder into Valheim.
The parent `BepInExPack_Valheim` directory itself is not created in Valheim.

Linux `.sh` launch scripts are excluded for the Windows client pack.

## Future mods

Two package types are supported:

- `githubFolder` - recursively installs a folder from this repository.
- `file` - downloads an individual file; an optional `sha256` can verify it.

TDC-managed files are recorded locally so later TDC releases can remove files
that were part of the previous pack without deleting unrelated user mods.
